# TASK-27 9d: NetSurf in a window (exploratory).
serial init: gui: gpu on its own page
screen Type help to begin, or help tour.
screen ~> _
pause 3000
type netsurf http://10.0.2.2:@PORT@/\r
pause 20000
drag 400 119 700 640
pause 1500
shot netsurf-term
click 122 119
pause 3000
shot netsurf-closed
click 300 87
pause 500
type poweroff\r
exit
